  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the third vertex be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/90a0f36d-8e7d-44a8-9846-4a0d2e539da7-image.png\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 220px;\" /><br /><br />Since <math><mi>H</mi></math> is orthocenter of <math><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math><br /><br />Since the slope of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> hence the slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> will be <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Equation of line <math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />Similarly, since <math><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></math> is parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis hence <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> will be parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis and<br /><br />Equation of line <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />On solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>The point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies in the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math> quadrant.</p></blockquote>",
